He believed souls weren't merely spiritual entities.","newText":"Opendis was a powerful mage and secret adherent of [[Orcus]], obsessed with the boundary between life and death. His research was part of the same cult’s wider effort to weaponize the Arcanite extracted from [[Blacklung Quarry]]. The cult’s promised reward was not wealth or immortality, but an army of the dead.

He believed souls weren't merely spiritual entities."}

