{"path":"content/Adventures/DM Notes/FLS/Tier 1/Jars of Souls.md","oldText":"Opendis was a powerful mage obsessed with the boundary between life and death.

He believed souls weren't merely spiritual entities.","newText":"Opendis was a powerful mage and secret adherent of [[Orcus]], obsessed with the boundary between life and death. His research was part of the same cult’s wider effort to weaponize the Arcanite extracted from [[Blacklung Quarry]]. The cult’s promised reward was not wealth or immortality, but an army of the dead.

He believed souls weren't merely spiritual entities."}

{"path":"content/Adventures/DM Notes/FLS/Tier 1/Jars of Souls.md","oldText":"But the discoveries within the tomb raise a much larger question.

Opendis spent decades gathering souls.","newText":"But the discoveries within the tomb raise a much larger question. The Orcus cult did not build this laboratory for Opendis alone. They were using it as a collection site, then funneling the harvested souls and Arcanite toward the ritual beneath [[Blacklung Quarry]].

Opendis spent decades gathering souls."}

{"path":"content/Adventures/DM Notes/FLS/Tier 1/Jars of Souls.md","oldText":"Eventually they learn the truth:

**Opendis knows their names.**","newText":"Eventually they learn the truth:

**Opendis knows their names—and the cult beneath [[Blacklung Quarry]] knows they have found the jars.**"}

