      "content": "40|---\n41|\n42|# Reaching the Tomb\n43|\n44|The tomb lies roughly **two days from Haverton** through dense forest.\n45|\n46|The journey doesn't need to be a full wilderness adventure. Instead, use it to establish the increasingly unnatural atmosphere surrounding the tomb.\n47|\n48|During the second day, animals become scarce.\n49|\n50|Birdsong disappears.\n51|\n52|That evening, characters occasionally hear whispers between the trees."
    }
