      "content": "276|# 7. Ritual Chamber\n277|\n278|The doors open onto an enormous circular chamber.\n279|\n280|Broken ritual equipment covers the floor.\n281|\n282|Black candles have melted into strange shapes.\n283|\n284|Silver wire forms incomplete magical circles.\n285|\n286|And surrounding the central ritual platform are **four active Jars of Souls**.\n287|\n288|Unlike the two inert vessels in Area 3, these jars are connected to the ritual machinery and actively power the undead guardians.\n289|\n290|Ghostly figures visibly swirl within them.\n291|\n292|Some pound desperately against the inside of the glass.\n293|\n294|Among them are the souls of the adventurers who disappeared from [[Doobius House]]. As the characters enter, spectral guardians rise from the floor.",
