      "content": "361|_\"He'll come back for them.\"_\n362|\n363|Then the chamber falls silent.\n364|\n365|### Take the Jars\n366|\n367|The characters can instead remove the jars.\n368|\n369|The dungeon contains six jars total: two inert jars in Area 3 and four active jars in Area 7. Skarguther values intact inert jars at **100 gp each** and intact active jars at **300 gp each**.\n370|\n371|Possessing one, however, is both dangerous and morally questionable.\n372|\n373|### Study Them\n374|\n375|A character who spends 10 minutes examining a jar and succeeds on a **DC 14 Intelligence (Arcana)** check realizes the vessels could potentially be modified.\n376|\n377|They don't merely contain souls.\n378|\n379|They can **transfer their spiritual energy into another ritual or magical object**."
