      "content": "240|- The Free League wants a public report and names of surviving cult agents.\n241|\n242|## Adventure Rewards\n243|\n244|**900 XP each** for completing the adventure. This is a long Tier 1 adventure for 4th-level characters under [[Character Advancement]].\n245|\n246|Additional rewards:\n247|\n248|- **500 gp total** from the public Guildhall contract, divided among the party.\n249|- **200 gp total** from Skarguther for the Ash Ledger and proof of the cult’s network, divided among the party.\n250|- **+50 XP each** for rescuing Marnie Sporegood and Tallow Wick.\n251|- **+100 XP each** for purifying the final vessel and releasing the trapped souls safely.\n252|- **+100 XP each** for preserving the spring and preventing contamination of the waterworks.\n253|- A story award for identifying surviving members of the Orcus network.\n254|- Access to future work from [[The Seekers of the Vein]], the [[Order of the Emerald Breath]], or [[The Roach Clip]].\n255|\n256|If the characters complete only part of the adventure, use the partial-XP guidelines in [[Character Advancement]].",
